WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.275
Every decision here has one owner, and that's
what keeps the HR track from stalling.

2
00:00:05.275 --> 00:00:09.225
Identity engineering owns the
plumbing and the delegation model.

3
00:00:09.225 --> 00:00:13.550
The ICAM governance body owns the
authority map and the person key.

4
00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:16.819
HR owns the codes, the
data architect the schema,

5
00:00:16.819 --> 00:00:20.087
and application owners
their own access rules.

6
00:00:20.087 --> 00:00:22.187
The CISO owns the controls.

7
00:00:22.187 --> 00:00:27.655
And you can start Monday without new tools:
export the tree, name the HR feed early,

8
00:00:27.655 --> 00:00:32.376
populate the person key, remove other
writers, and route your logs out.

9
00:00:32.376 --> 00:00:33.500
So what's left?
